+Subject: [PATCH] Report: the --limit flag of tally report
+
+Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
+---
+ README.md                |  4 +++-
+ bin/tally                |  6 ++++--
+ src/ledger.js            |  6 ++++--
+ test/unit/cli.test.js    | 11 +++++++++++
